  "appDefinitionTitle": "What is Library Manager?",
  "appDefinitionContent": "Library Manager is a professional desktop solution designed for Algerian libraries and documentation centers. It provides specialized tools for inventory management, LAN-based synchronization, and barcode tracking. The system supports full English, French, and Arabic categorization following national standards.",
  "helpMembersTitle": "Member Management",
  "helpMembersContent": "1. Go to the 'Members' tab to add or edit registered users.\n2. Each member is assigned a unique ID (e.g., 260001) formatted for national registration.\n3. Track loan history, active borrows, and registration dates per member.",
  "helpLoansTitle": "Loan System",
  "helpLoansContent": "1. Scanning an item in the 'Loans' screen starts the checkout process.\n2. Enter the member ID or scan their membership card to link the loan.\n3. Return items by scanning them again in the 'Prêts' section or manually marking them as returned in history.",
  "helpSyncTitle": "LAN Synchronization",
  "helpSyncContent": "1. One machine must be set as the 'Host' (Server) while others are 'Clients'.\n2. Clients connect using the Host's IP address. Pair automatically by scanning the Host's sync QR code.\n3. Changes on any device are mirrored to the server via local network protocols.",
  "helpBarcodeTitle": "Barcode Scanning",
  "helpBarcodeContent": "1. Integrated Camera: Supports front/back/external camera toggling with LED flash support.\n2. USB Scanners: Plug-and-play support in any search field.\n3. Multiple Devices: Switch between available cameras using the device selection dropdown in the scanner window."
